  "sourceTitle": "Toasted Tuna Salad Sandwich with a KICK",
  "sourceText": "Toasted Tuna Salad Sandwich with a KICK\nBy: Barbara Pendleton\nPublished: Tuesday, June 19, 2012 - 10:32am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 Large can of Tuna\n2 heaping tbsp of Mayo\n1/4 cup chopped pecans\n1 Hard boil egg\n2 tsp Grey Poupon Dijon Mustard\nSalt and Pepper to taste\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Mix all ingredients except Mayo and Mustard. 2 Chop all content with a knife. 3 Mix in Mayo and Mustard 4 Add Salt and Pepper\n\nAbout\n\nChopped Tuna Salad with a BITE of character",
